# krummholz_a: a wind-flattened mat of subalpine fir on the crest, where the
# trees grow sideways (BUILD_PLAN S5 brief B5): a low lumpy band, spruce
# (11) underneath and on its shadowed left end, forest (12) on top, with two
# short upright tips. The anchor, 0,0, is its foot, at the middle. 10 wide,
# 5 tall.
C 11  L -5,-1  L -5,0 4,0
C 12  L -3,-4  L -4,-3 -3,-3  L 2,-3  L -4,-2 0,-2  L 2,-2 4,-2
      L -4,-1 4,-1
